{"4930920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Songs of Wasteland", "steam_appid": 4930920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Songs of Wasteland is a horror third-person shooter. You play as a lone hero Emma who wanders the wasteland which has no sign of civilization. Only terrifying monsters lurk in the shadows and underground. Shoot, explore, and survive, the future of humanity is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930920/extras/35f441a44b17c007ddba08330438af54.avif?t=1785061642\" width=780 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Terrifying World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is an empty world on the surface, where have all the humans gone? However something terrifying lurks in the shadows and underground：twisted monsters look like humans, or, used to be humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930920/extras/5b04fb098aa70cdb8fb3f61d4ee96017.avif?t=1785061642\" width=500 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Lone Adventurer Emma</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emma is not a trained fighter, but she needs to learn how to protect herself when she walks out of that shelter, and becomes a fighter along the journey. Can Emma discover why the world becomes like this and eventually find the way to save the world? It is all up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930920/extras/a70d82fc0bb1f82c2a3730a41b8f4a99.avif?t=1785061642\" width=500 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Abilities and Weapons Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the journey, Emma will grow and will become more capable. New weapons, gears and upgrades will be discovered along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930920/extras/5c6888bda2f4d5081ed991fd634ee0fb.avif?t=1785061642\" width=500 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nostalgia for the Old World When the Humans Flourish</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes old artifacts or pieces of old technology may be discovered on the wasteland. Emma can learn how the humans live in the old times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930920/extras/9331428939b484e31dce8712725baa6f.avif?t=1785061642\" width=500 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration and Collectables</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emma can collect decorative items and outfits by exploring the game world, and adventure in style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features multiple endings based on player choice when progressing through the campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Songs of Wasteland is a horror third-person shooter. You play as a lone hero Emma who wanders the wasteland which has no sign of civilization. Only terrifying monsters lurk in the shadows and underground. Shoot, explore, and survive, the future of humanity is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930920/extras/35f441a44b17c007ddba08330438af54.avif?t=1785061642\" width=780 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Terrifying World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is an empty world on the surface, where have all the humans gone? However something terrifying lurks in the shadows and underground：twisted monsters look like humans, or, used to be humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930920/extras/5b04fb098aa70cdb8fb3f61d4ee96017.avif?t=1785061642\" width=500 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Lone Adventurer Emma</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emma is not a trained fighter, but she needs to learn how to protect herself when she walks out of that shelter, and becomes a fighter along the journey. Can Emma discover why the world becomes like this and eventually find the way to save the world? It is all up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930920/extras/a70d82fc0bb1f82c2a3730a41b8f4a99.avif?t=1785061642\" width=500 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Abilities and Weapons Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the journey, Emma will grow and will become more capable. New weapons, gears and upgrades will be discovered along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930920/extras/5c6888bda2f4d5081ed991fd634ee0fb.avif?t=1785061642\" width=500 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nostalgia for the Old World When the Humans Flourish</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes old artifacts or pieces of old technology may be discovered on the wasteland. Emma can learn how the humans live in the old times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930920/extras/9331428939b484e31dce8712725baa6f.avif?t=1785061642\" width=500 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration and Collectables</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emma can collect decorative items and outfits by exploring the game world, and adventure in style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features multiple endings based on player choice when progressing through the campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Songs of Wasteland is a horror third-person shooter. You play as a lone hero Emma who wanders the wasteland which has no sign of civilization. Only terrifying monsters lurk in the shadows and underground. Shoot, explore, and survive, the future of humanity is in your hands.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930920/d535d10a6c9318a828c2ad6bb785fc7b4eb7dead/header.jpg?t=1785061642", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930920/bfe0f2a7038365d4be15f4cdc7f1103c66ed5b9f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785061642", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930920/bfe0f2a7038365d4be15f4cdc7f1103c66ed5b9f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785061642", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or equivalent<br></li><li><st